END_VAR]]></Declaration>
      <Implementation><ST><![CDATA[AcceptReceivedTopicForTest := AcceptReceivedTopic(bTopicReceived := bTopicReceived, nTopicSize := nTopicSize, sTopic := sTopic);]]></ST></Implementation>
